WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.785 --> 00:00:02.025
A delivery is waiting.

2
00:00:02.465 --> 00:00:03.825
The corridor is blocked.

3
00:00:04.345 --> 00:00:06.445
Three robots share the same space,

4
00:00:06.825 --> 00:00:08.145
but they don't share the same

5
00:00:08.145 --> 00:00:08.585
job.

6
00:00:09.025 --> 00:00:11.585
The scout inspects, recovery moves the

7
00:00:11.585 --> 00:00:14.025
obstruction, and the system measures what

8
00:00:14.085 --> 00:00:15.145
actually changed.

9
00:00:18.105 --> 00:00:19.565
This is Witness Fleet.

10
00:00:19.865 --> 00:00:21.585
It connects physical evidence to the

11
00:00:21.585 --> 00:00:22.765
authority to act.

12
00:00:23.085 --> 00:00:25.985
In FalkorDB, the source, the policy,

13
00:00:26.105 --> 00:00:28.185
the owner, and the observation are

14
00:00:28.185 --> 00:00:29.525
connected to the command.

15
00:00:29.885 --> 00:00:31.685
An AI can suggest a move.

16
00:00:31.965 --> 00:00:33.825
It cannot grant itself permission.

17
00:00:36.675 --> 00:00:37.894
Now the route is clear,

18
00:00:38.335 --> 00:00:39.455
but watch the courier.

19
00:00:42.075 --> 00:00:42.795
It waits

20
00:00:43.235 --> 00:00:45.275
because a clear path is not

21
00:00:45.275 --> 00:00:45.875
permission.

22
00:00:47.425 --> 00:00:49.445
This recorded run uses a configured

23
00:00:49.445 --> 00:00:52.285
demo-owner release, a scripted action, not

24
00:00:52.285 --> 00:00:53.425
human authentication.

25
00:00:55.405 --> 00:00:57.445
Only then does the courier approach,

26
00:01:03.755 --> 00:01:05.235
check the route with fresh evidence

27
00:01:05.235 --> 00:01:05.815
of its own,

28
00:01:11.165 --> 00:01:12.505
and complete the delivery.

29
00:01:14.005 --> 00:01:15.805
Not just a command sent, an

30
00:01:15.825 --> 00:01:18.285
outcome observed, and a receipt tied

31
00:01:18.285 --> 00:01:19.105
to that command.

32
00:01:20.205 --> 00:01:23.265
Seven verified task outcomes, one traceable

33
00:01:23.285 --> 00:01:23.745
mission.

34
00:01:25.105 --> 00:01:26.445
And if an outcome is unknown,

35
00:01:26.745 --> 00:01:27.865
the system holds.

36
00:01:28.084 --> 00:01:29.825
It doesn't guess and send again.

37
00:01:31.185 --> 00:01:33.885
This is a simulation-first system, not

38
00:01:33.885 --> 00:01:35.965
production robot safety certification.

39
00:01:39.165 --> 00:01:39.905
Witness Fleet.

40
00:01:40.285 --> 00:01:41.105
See what happened.

41
00:01:41.405 --> 00:01:42.385
Follow the evidence,

42
00:01:42.845 --> 00:01:44.745
then decide what moves next.
